    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d256">

                <pb facs="0365" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg345"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/7–1050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Douglas</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-10T20:00:00+01:00">July 10, 1950—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 10—3:26 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>209. Eyes only for Secretary. Re Embtel 184
                    (repeated Moscow 14).<anchor n="1" xml:id="d256-f1"/> My immediately following
                    telegram contains text revised instructions to Kelly.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d256-f2"/> Underlined portions indicate changes made to incorporate
                    your comments. This appears satisfactory.</p>
                <p>Department pass Moscow. Moscow eyes only for Ambassador 17.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Douglas</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d256-f1" n="1" xml:id="d256-f1-content">
                <p>Received on July 10 at 12:50 p. m., <ref target="#pg344">p. 344</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d256-f2" n="2" xml:id="d256-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram 210, from London, received on July 10 at 5:52 p. m., <ref
                        target="#pg352">p. 352</ref>.</p>
